---@field is_marijuana_business? boolean Whether or not the company is a marijuana-related business.
---@field is_partner_managed? boolean Whether the company is fully managed by a partner via the API
---@field is_suspended? boolean Whether or not the company is suspended in Gusto. Suspended companies may not run payroll.
---@field join_date? string|distilled.Null Company's first invoiceable event date
---@field locations? gusto.CompanyLocationsList The locations of the company.
