---@field errors? gusto.EntityErrorObjectErrorsList Will only exist if category is `nested_errors`. It is possible to have multiple levels of nested errors.
---@field message? string Provides details about the error - generally this message can be surfaced to an end user.
---@field metadata? gusto.EntityErrorObjectMetadata Contains relevant data to identify the resource in question when applicable. For example, to identify an entity `entity_type` and `entity_uuid` will be provided.

