---@field expiration_date? string|distilled.Null The date the employee benefit will expire. A null value indicates the benefit will not expire.
---@field limit_option? gusto.PutEmployeeBenefitRequestLimitOption|string|distilled.Null Some benefits require additional information to determine their limit. `Family` or `Individual`: Applicable to HSA benefit. `Joint Filing or Single` or `Married and Filing Separately`: Applicable to Dependent Care FSA benefit.
